e":"vndb","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"54"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A childhood friend and classmate who grew up playing together through neighborhood connections. Pure-hearted, considerate, and completely genuine, she's beloved by everyone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Member of the ‘(Boob) Volleyball Club’. Despite having upperclassmen in the club, she's already widely recognized as the next club president—a dependable person."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's delighted to reunite with the protagonist and treats him just as they did back then. However, feelings begin to blossom between them, different from their childhood friendship..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's actually quite the jealous type, but she always thinks of the other person's feelings and bravely endures it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c33134"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"E地区に住む主人公の幼馴染で、クラスメイト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園では「（おっぱい）バレー部」に所属。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"笑顔を絶やさず、純粋で思いやりがあり、部内でも早くから次期部長として支持を集めるリーダー的な存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と久しぶりに再会し、当時とは違った男女としての意識が芽生え始めている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21045","sourceWorkId":"9068","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃、近所付き合いから仲良く遊んでいた幼なじみのクラスメイト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"純粋で思いやりのある裏表の無い性格で、みんなから好かれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『（おっぱい）バレー部』所属。部内では上級生もいる中、早くも次期部長との呼び声が高いしっかり者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公との再会を喜び、当時の関係のまま仲良く接してくれる。しかし徐々に当時とは違う男女としての意識が芽生え始め…。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実はかなりのヤキモチ焼きだが、相手の気持ちを考えいつも健気に我慢。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"45314"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"91 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21045","sourceWorkId":"9068","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"e","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","source