 her age she can talk to easily."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c33137"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"G地区に住む、主人公の先輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「（おっぱい）弓道部」に所属。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"茶道の名門家である流倉流の一人娘で、古風なお嬢様のような雰囲気を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は、やや天然だが、真面目で、淑やかで、温厚。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人見知りするタイプではないが、温室育ちのためか、男性にあまり免疫がないようだ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21048","sourceWorkId":"9068","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"上級生。『（おっぱい）弓道部』所属。茶道の名門家、流倉流の一人娘で、古風なお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"温室育ちで、性格は真面目で温厚。おしとやか。が、多少天然な性格も手伝ってか、のんびり過ぎるところも？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人見知りというわけではないが、男性に対してあまり免疫がない為、主人公は的にとって同年代で唯一気さくに話せる男子らしい。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"45317"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"97 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21048","sourceWorkId":"9068","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"g","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21048","sourceWorkId":"9068","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"164.5 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21048","sourceWorkId":"9068","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"87 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21048","sourceWorkId":"9068","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21048","sourceWorkId":"9068","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/87/87025aec2d1e3825b0ef29e608d0d17d565fb34ce2a5e89067709921890ff601.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/21/21ac6cba92ca6305b5e18e0ef9ccce2a049afb37d3ea7b315d3350ad601ee405.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"南見