a Sake Brewery, a long-established shop in town. She's the beloved poster girl of the shopping district, known for her adorable efforts working at the storefront."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While she has a bright and cheerful personality, she's also quite shy. She's a genuinely sweet girl who blushes bright red and beams with happiness when praised by others, including the protagonist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She hits it off with the protagonist, who has just moved in, and they begin interacting. Each time they meet, she blushes and fidgets nervously, her earnestness making her utterly endearing."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c33141"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"F地区に住む、街の老舗「奈波酒蔵」の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"店先に立って、訪れるお客さんを明るく迎える姿が可愛らしいと評判の看板娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恥かしがり屋さんで、人に褒められるともじもじと頬を赤く染めながら喜ぶ素直な良い娘。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21052","sourceWorkId":"9068","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"街の老舗、奈波酒蔵の娘。店先で頑張っている姿が可愛い、と商店街でも評判の看板娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ぱっと明るい性格の一方、恥ずかしがりやな面もあり、主人公を始め人に誉められると顔を真っ赤にして喜ぶ素直な「いい娘」。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"引っ越したばかりの主人公と気が合い、交流を持ち始める。会う度に頬を染め、もじもじとする様子が一途でかわいらしい。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"45321"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"93 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21052","sourceWorkId":"9068","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"f","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21052","sourceWorkId":"9068","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"162 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21052","sourceWorkId":"9068","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21052","sourceWorkId":"9068","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"57 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21052",